  "html": "<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"노드-정의하기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#노드-정의하기\" class=\"peer\">노드 정의하기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p><strong>Design</strong> 탭에서는 Rules(공통 규칙) · Nodes · Edges 를 정의하고, 완성한 설계를 마크다운 파일로 내보낼 수 있습니다(<strong>MD Export</strong>).</p>\n<h3 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"노드-속성\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#노드-속성\" class=\"peer\">노드 속성</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h3>\n<p>노드의 속성은 두 종류로 나뉩니다.</p>\n<div class=\"relative overflow-auto prose-no-margin my-6\"><table><thead><tr><th>구분</th><th>내용</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>시스템 속성</strong></td><td><code>id</code> · <code>source_ref</code> · <code>name</code> — 시스템이 자동으로 포함시키는 속성입니다</td></tr><tr><td><strong>사용자 정의 속성</strong></td><td>사용자 의도대로 정의하는 속성으로, UI 에서 가이드하는 규칙에 따라 입력합니다</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p><code>source_ref</code> 는 추출한 값의 근거를 남기는 속성입니다. 자세한 내용은 <a href=\"#/detail/ontology/data#%EB%AC%B8%EC%84%9C%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-ai-%EB%A1%9C-%EC%B6%94%EC%B6%9C%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\">문서에서 AI 로 추출하기</a>를 참고하세요.</p></div></div></div>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"엣지-정의하기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#엣지-정의하기\" class=\"peer\">엣지 정의하기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>엣지는 <strong>노드가 2개 이상일 때</strong> 생성할 수 있으며, <strong>소스 노드와 타겟 노드를 연결</strong>함으로써 정의합니다.</p>\n<p>엣지의 속성도 노드와 마찬가지로 <a href=\"#/detail/ontology/design#%EC%A7%80%EC%9B%90-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0-%ED%83%80%EC%9E%85\">지원 데이터 타입</a>에 따라 입력합니다.</p>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"지원-데이터-타입\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#지원-데이터-타입\" class=\"peer\">지원 데이터 타입</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p>노드 및 엣지의 속성으로 지원되는 데이터 타입은 다음과 같습니다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>STRING</code></li>\n<li><code>INTEGER</code></li>\n<li><code>FLOAT</code></li>\n<li><code>BOOLEAN</code></li>\n<li><code>DATE</code></li>\n<li><code>DATETIME</code></li>\n<li><code>LIST_STRING</code></li>\n<li><code>LIST_INTEGER</code></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2 my-4 rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-3 ps-1 text-sm text-fd-card-foreground shadow-md\" style=\"--callout-color:var(--color-fd-info, var(--color-fd-muted))\"><div role=\"none\" class=\"w-0.5 bg-(--callout-color)/50 rounded-sm\"></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-5 -me-0.5 fill-(--callout-color) text-fd-card\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-0 flex-1\"><div class=\"text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><ul>\n<li><code>STRING</code> · <code>INTEGER</code> 타입에는 <strong>Enum 값</strong>을 정의할 수 있습니다.</li>\n<li>중첩 속성을 정의하고 싶을 때는 <code>level_1.level_2</code> 포맷과 같은 방식을 이용합니다.</li>\n</ul></div></div></div>\n<h2 class=\"flex scroll-m-28 flex-row items-center gap-2\" id=\"기존-프로젝트의-설계-복제하기\"><a data-card=\"\" href=\"#기존-프로젝트의-설계-복제하기\" class=\"peer\">기존 프로젝트의 설계 복제하기</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide size-3.5 shrink-0 text-fd-muted-foreground opacity-0 transition-opacity peer-hover:opacity-100\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></h2>\n<p><strong>Design</strong> 탭에서 <strong>+ Copy from Project</strong> 버튼을 누르면 복제 가능한 설계를 가진 프로젝트 목록이 표시됩니다.\n같은 설계를 공유하는 기존 프로젝트의 설계를 재사용하고 싶을 때 사용합니다.</p>"
}